From 3e7c626ba9a31768a2ed512c2455970505fb808a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Chris Kearney <303316+iconidentify@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 09:52:50 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 31/31] brcmfmac: accept bounded version 116 scan records

Accept the version 116 common scan prefix with its 172-byte fixed header. Validate record lengths, SSID and rates counts, and record-relative IE spans before scan callbacks, deduplication, and reporting. Keep versions 109 through 112 supported and reject unknown formats.

Signed-off-by: Chris Kearney <303316+iconidentify@users.noreply.github.com>
(cherry picked from commit a6a62e586021d9f786d6a96b4ded6b0ad3b613fa)
